1
00:00:00,200 --> 00:00:01,933
Geet had main character energy.

2
00:00:01,933 --> 00:00:03,933
She just needed prototype energy.

3
00:00:04,200 --> 00:00:06,833
She imagined an entire future with Anshuman,

4
00:00:06,833 --> 00:00:08,667
and treated that imagination

5
00:00:08,667 --> 00:00:10,600
like a confirmed plan.

6
00:00:11,200 --> 00:00:12,533
The problem?

7
00:00:12,633 --> 00:00:14,500
Anshuman was a hypothesis,

8
00:00:14,500 --> 00:00:15,800
not a plan.

9
00:00:17,200 --> 00:00:20,133
Life prototyping means testing a big decision

10
00:00:20,133 --> 00:00:22,800
with a smaller, lower-risk experiment first.

11
00:00:22,800 --> 00:00:23,733
Less guessing,

12
00:00:23,733 --> 00:00:24,933
more learning.

13
00:00:25,200 --> 00:00:27,367
So instead of immediately running away,

14
00:00:27,367 --> 00:00:30,033
LDL Geet could ask the hard questions,

15
00:00:30,033 --> 00:00:31,467
visit without committing,

16
00:00:31,467 --> 00:00:34,400
and see if this future actually works.

17
00:00:36,200 --> 00:00:38,100
Geet didn't need less heart.

18
00:00:38,100 --> 00:00:39,833
She needed one small test

19
00:00:39,833 --> 00:00:41,733
before one massive leap.
